The game programs in this directory are derived from the games of the ARC-AGI-3 Public Demo Set of the ARC Prize
Foundation.

gamesofts/modify/ holds instrumented versions, taken at an earlier revision from the instrumented game files of
a concurrent study (credited once it is published), whose modifications add transition records of the visible changes and
comments describing each game. We removed some comments, docstrings and display strings; the code is otherwise
unchanged.
environment_files/ holds unmodified game files.

gamesofts/_action_log.py is not a game file; it is licensed separately (see its header).

The game programs are distributed under the license below.

